89 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Eyecan is an innovative project that simulates smart glasses, enabling individuals who have lost the ability to speak or move due to wars, neurological injuries, diseases, or other harsh circumstances to communicate freely and easily using only eye movements. Many of these individuals once lived normal lives full of social interaction, mobility, and self-expression, but suddenly lost the sensory or physical abilities they once relied on. Eyecan aims to restore part of this lost life by providing a direct way to express thoughts and needs, giving users the opportunity to regain independence and dignity. )
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
