/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Many individuals around the world suddenly lose the ability to speak or move due to wars, neurological injuries, illnesses, or other harsh circumstances. This sudden loss prevents them from expressing their thoughts, needs, or interacting with their social environment, leading to feelings of isolation, loss of independence, and diminished dignity.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [2]
>>
