<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Although some assistive devices exist, most are either difficult to use, expensive, or fail to provide a natural interactive experience, especially for people with severe disabilities. This creates a significant gap between these individuals and the world around them, increasing their social isolation and limiting effective communication.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
