102 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (In a world where many individuals face significant physical and psychological challenges due to wars, injuries, or illnesses, some suddenly lose the ability to speak or hear, finding themselves cut off from their surroundings and unable to express their thoughts and needs. After the Gaza war, we witnessed many cases where people lost their speech or hearing due to physical and psychological trauma, and even after the conflict ended, they continue to struggle, unable to return to their normal lives.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
