104 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The project aims to empower these individuals to regain part of their independence and dignity by providing a seamless communication method using only eye movements, combining technology to restore a sense of life and lost senses. The goal is not merely technological; it is about creating a fully human experience, where the user feels heard, understood, and able to express themselves safely and freely. Eyecan becomes a window to the world, a means to restore social connections, reclaim a sense of worth and dignity, and live a life closer to the one they had before circumstances stripped them of their senses.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [4]
>>
